1. Clone the Repository
git clone https://github.com/NguinfackFranck/Python-Habit-Tracking-Application
cd habit-tracker
2. Create a Virtual Environment (optional but recommended)
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # macOS/Linux
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows
3. Install Dependencies
pip install click
pytest

Running the Application
Run the habit tracker from the command line:
python main.py

If using Click:
python main.py <command> [options]

CLI Commands
 create "[name]" "[task]" periodicity[daily or weekly]
 complete "Exercise"
Commands lists:
  analyze   Analyze longest streaks for all habits.
  complete  Mark a habit as completed.
  create    Create a new habit.
  delete    Delete a habit.
  list      List all habits.
